Hi Erik,

You need to set season to one of the "levels" of the factor. And if you are making a prediction for 1 level, you need to specify the other levels too. Something like this should work:

nd <- data.frame(gr=0, wind=0,  season=factor("sea.1", levels=c(unique(season)),
                                               date=seq(4,282,length=282)))

Richard

