Hi Erik,

I think there is a misplaced bracket in there:

nd <- data.frame(gr=0, wind=0, season=factor("sea.1",levels=c(unique(season)), date=seq(4,282,length=282)))

should read

nd <- data.frame(gr=0, wind=0, season=factor("sea.1",levels=c(unique(season))), date=seq(4,282,length=282))

which I think is the source of this particular error message.

Chris

